Faces
Description
This program is part of the CS50 Python problem set. It converts text emoticons into graphical emoji equivalents.

If the user types certain emoticons such as :) or :(, the program replaces them with their corresponding emoji.

How It Works
The program asks the user to input a line of text.
It searches for emoticons in the text.
The emoticons are replaced with the appropriate emoji.
The updated text is printed as output.
Example
Input: Hello :)

Output: Hello 🙂

